# Global media delivery domains | Shadowrocket RULE-SET
# International services only. Curated starter list, 2026-10-11. Not exhaustive; validate using Shadowrocket connection logs.
# Domains only. No IP-CIDR / full service APIs / shared CDN root domains.

# YouTube: video transport and image assets
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlevideo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ytimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ggpht.com

# X / Twitter: photos and videos
DOMAIN,pbs.twimg.com
DOMAIN,video.twimg.com

